@host = http://localhost:8080

### health
GET {{host}}/health

### register
POST {{host}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"me@example.com","password":"supersecret1"}

### login  (copy "token" from the response into @token below)
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"me@example.com","password":"supersecret1"}

### me
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### logout
POST {{host}}/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
